<h1>How Fast Is the <em>Average Person</em> in MPH?</h1>
<div class="hero-meta">
<span class="hero-meta-item">📖 7 min read</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">⚡ Sprint Speed</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">📊 Human Performance</span>
